From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregor MacLennan <gmaclennan@awana.digital>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 13:10:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lib: install a WebAssembly polyfill when the engine has none

A jitless V8 (required on iOS) exposes no WebAssembly global, which
kills fetch(): undici parses HTTP with a wasm build of llhttp. Bundle
polywasm (pure-JS WebAssembly, MIT) as an internal dep and install it
at startup only when the engine has none, so Android and desktop keep
V8's implementation. Gated by test-mobile-fetch on every leg and the
jitless/frozen-intrinsics host gates in smoke-host.
---
